      "questions": "<section class=\"part-section\">\n    <div class=\"qgroup\">\n      <h3>Questions 1–10</h3>\n      <div class=\"instr\">Complete the notes below. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.</div>\n      <div class=\"note-card\">\n        <h2>Tour Booking Enquiry</h2>\n        <p>Type of holiday: <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">1</strong><input id=\"practice_18_1_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_1\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 1\"></span></span></p>\n\n        <h4>Hotel</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Meal: including <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">2</strong><input id=\"practice_18_2_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_2\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 2\"></span></span></li>\n          <li>Facilities: a pool, a nightclub and a <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">3</strong><input id=\"practice_18_3_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_3\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 3\"></span></span></li>\n          <li>Prices: reduce from £<span class=\"fillbox narrow\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">4</strong><input id=\"practice_18_4_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_4\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 4\"></span></span> to £315</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h4>Self-catering Apartment</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Stay in a <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">5</strong><input id=\"practice_18_5_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_5\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 5\"></span></span> room</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h4>Equipment Rental</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Rental for one week: £<span class=\"fillbox narrow\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">6</strong><input id=\"practice_18_6_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_6\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 6\"></span></span></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h4>Types of Insurance</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">7</strong><input id=\"practice_18_7_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_7\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 7\"></span></span> Cover: £30</li>\n          <li>Premier cover: £<span class=\"fillbox narrow\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">8</strong><input id=\"practice_18_8_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_8\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 8\"></span></span></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h4>Transport</h4>\n        <p>The cheapest way of going to the airport: by <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">9</strong><input id=\"practice_18_9_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_9\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 9\"></span></span></p>\n\n        <h4>Payment Method</h4>\n        <p>Pay by <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">10</strong><input id=\"practice_18_10_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_10\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 10\"></span></span>: no extra fee</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
