      "questions": "<section class=\"part-section\">\n    <div class=\"qgroup\">\n      <h3>Questions 21–22</h3>\n      <div class=\"instr\">Complete the notes below. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.</div>\n      <div class=\"note-card\">\n        <h2>Assignment Feedback</h2>\n        <h4>Things that need to be done:</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Hand in book reports with the next assignment</li>\n          <li>Check accuracy of the <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">21</strong><input id=\"practice_18_21_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_21\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 21\"></span></span> in the last section</li>\n          <li>Give more <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">22</strong><input id=\"practice_18_22_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_22\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 22\"></span></span></li>\n          <li>Expand ideas to improve the grade</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qgroup\">\n      <h3>Questions 23–27</h3>\n      <div class=\"instr\">Answer the questions below. Write NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS for each answer.</div>\n      <div class=\"note-card\">\n        <p>23  When will Karen give her presentation? <span class=\"fillbox wide\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">23</strong><input id=\"practice_18_23_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_23\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 23\"></span></span></p>\n        <p>24  What must she do during the presentation? <span class=\"fillbox wide\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">24</strong><input id=\"practice_18_24_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_24\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 24\"></span></span></p>\n        <p>25  By which date does she have to submit an abstract? <span class=\"fillbox wide\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">25</strong><input id=\"practice_18_25_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_25\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 25\"></span></span></p>\n        <p>26  Where will the presentation take place? <span class=\"fillbox wide\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">26</strong><input id=\"practice_18_26_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_26\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 26\"></span></span></p>\n        <p>27  Who will grade her presentation? <span class=\"fillbox wide\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">27</strong><input id=\"practice_18_27_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_27\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 27\"></span></span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qgroup\">\n      <h3>Questions 28–30</h3>\n      <div class=\"instr\">Choose THREE letters, A–H. Which THREE modules will Karen study next year? (Your three answers can be in any order.)</div>\n      \n      \n    <div class=\"checkbox-group ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">28</strong><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">29</strong><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">30</strong><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"A\" name=\"practice_18_28_30\" id=\"practice_18_28_30_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 28: A\">A  Communication Skills</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"B\" name=\"practice_18_28_30\" id=\"practice_18_28_30_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 28: B\">B  Data Collection</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"C\" name=\"practice_18_28_30\" id=\"practice_18_28_30_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 28: C\">C  Discourse Analysis</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"D\" name=\"practice_18_28_30\" id=\"practice_18_28_30_D\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 28: D\">D  Language and Society</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"E\" name=\"practice_18_28_30\" id=\"practice_18_28_30_E\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 28: E\">E  Phonology</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"F\" name=\"practice_18_28_30\" id=\"practice_18_28_30_F\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 28: F\">F  Psycholinguistics</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"G\" name=\"practice_18_28_30\" id=\"practice_18_28_30_G\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 28: G\">G  Research Methodology</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"H\" name=\"practice_18_28_30\" id=\"practice_18_28_30_H\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 28: H\">H  Social Interaction</label></div></div>\n  </section>",
