      "questions": "<section class=\"part-section\">\n    <div class=\"qgroup\">\n      <h3>Questions 31–40</h3>\n      <div class=\"instr\">Complete the notes below. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.</div>\n      <div class=\"note-card\">\n        <h2>Research on Birds in Australia</h2>\n\n        <h4>The study by Cunningham in 1995</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>It aimed to study birds which were <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">31</strong><input id=\"practice_18_31_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_31\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 31\"></span></span> in cities</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h4>Methodology</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Researchers were able to <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">32</strong><input id=\"practice_18_32_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_32\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 32\"></span></span> rather than count birds (e.g. random sampling)</li>\n          <li>Studied birds' companionship habits using a <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">33</strong><input id=\"practice_18_33_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_33\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 33\"></span></span> system</li>\n          <li>Tags attached to birds' legs to identify their <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">34</strong><input id=\"practice_18_34_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_34\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 34\"></span></span> over time</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h4>Findings</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Birds tended to choose the same nesting site in which they were raised</li>\n          <li>Human activities such as <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">35</strong><input id=\"practice_18_35_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_35\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 35\"></span></span> had a negative effect on birds' reproduction</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h4>Measures by local organisations</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>To increase birds' rate of <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">36</strong><input id=\"practice_18_36_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_36\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 36\"></span></span> in various ways</li>\n          <li>To reduce dangers caused by <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">37</strong><input id=\"practice_18_37_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_37\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 37\"></span></span> farms (e.g. colliding with turbines)</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h4>The study by Conway in 2006</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Monitored the <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">38</strong><input id=\"practice_18_38_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_38\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 38\"></span></span> of birds' nocturnal callings during flight</li>\n          <li><span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">39</strong><input id=\"practice_18_39_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_39\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 39\"></span></span> were taken to listen to birds' sounds</li>\n          <li>Data collected through noise detection devices placed at a great <span class=\"fillbox\"><span class=\"ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">40</strong><input id=\"practice_18_40_\" placeholder=\"Answer\" name=\"practice_18_40\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 40\"></span></span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
